// ==============================================================
// tb_fastvit_top_tierb.sv -- Phase B3 standalone functional testbench
// for fastvit_top_tierb, bypassing this project's confirmed-broken
// HLS AUTOTB entirely (see project notes). Drives the 2 AXI4-Lite
// control buses as a bus-functional master and behaviorally models
// all 17 of the DUT's private AXI4 master ports as simple full-duplex
// memory slaves backed by one shared associative byte array (tb_mem),
// so cross-op memory reuse (e.g. a back-to-back sequence) behaves like
// real shared DRAM. Golden vectors are generated by fastvit_ip_tb.cpp
// (gen_golden_*() functions, see tier_b_rtl/golden/*.hex) -- NOT
// reimplemented in a second language, to avoid an independent-bug risk.
// ==============================================================
